## 动态规划解题步骤

### 1. 定义状态
- 明确dp数组的含义
- 确定状态的维度

### 2. 确定转移方程
- 找到状态之间的关系
- 明确如何从子问题推导当前问题

### 3. 确定初始条件
- dp数组的初始值
- 边界条件

### 4. 确定遍历顺序
- 确保计算当前状态时，依赖的状态已经计算

### 5. 确定返回值
- 明确最终答案在dp数组中的位置

### 示例：斐波那契数列
```java
// 1. 定义状态：dp[i] 表示第i个斐波那契数
// 2. 转移方程：dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]
// 3. 初始条件：dp[0] = 0, dp[1] = 1
// 4. 遍历顺序：从左到右
// 5. 返回值：dp[n]

public int fib(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return n;
    int[] dp = new int[n + 1];
    dp[0] = 0;
    dp[1] = 1;
    for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
        dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + dp[i - 2];
    }
    return dp[n];
}
```

## 动态规划空间优化

### 1. 滚动数组
当状态只依赖前一行（或前几行）时，可以使用滚动数组。

### 2. 一维优化
```java
// 原始DP：二维数组
int[][] dp = new int[m][n];

// 优化后：一维数组
int[] dp = new int[n];
```

### 3. 示例：0-1背包问题
```java
// 原始二维DP
int[][] dp = new int[n + 1][W + 1];
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
    for (int w = 0; w <= W; w++) {
        if (w >= weights[i - 1]) {
            dp[i][w] = Math.max(dp[i - 1][w], 
                               dp[i - 1][w - weights[i - 1]] + values[i - 1]);
        } else {
            dp[i][w] = dp[i - 1][w];
        }
    }
}

// 优化后一维DP
int[] dp = new int[W + 1];
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    for (int w = W; w >= weights[i]; w--) {
        dp[w] = Math.max(dp[w], dp[w - weights[i]] + values[i]);
    }
}
```

### 4. 为什么内层循环要逆序？
正序遍历会导致同一个物品被多次选择（完全背包问题），逆序遍历保证每个物品只选择一次（0-1背包问题）。

## 经典动态规划问题

### 1. 爬楼梯
```java
public int climbStairs(int n) {
    if (n <= 2) return n;
    int prev2 = 1, prev1 = 2;
    for (int i = 3; i <= n; i++) {
        int curr = prev1 + prev2;
        prev2 = prev1;
        prev1 = curr;
    }
    return prev1;
}
```

### 2. 最长递增子序列（LIS）
```java
public int lengthOfLIS(int[] nums) {
    int[] dp = new int[nums.length];
    Arrays.fill(dp, 1);
    int maxLen = 1;
    for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j < i; j++) {
            if (nums[j] < nums[i]) {
                dp[i] = Math.max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1);
            }
        }
        maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, dp[i]);
    }
    return maxLen;
}
```

### 3. 最长公共子序列（LCS）
```java
public int longestCommonSubsequence(String text1, String text2) {
    int m = text1.length(), n = text2.length();
    int[][] dp = new int[m + 1][n + 1];
    for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {
        for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {
            if (text1.charAt(i - 1) == text2.charAt(j - 1)) {
                dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1;
            } else {
                dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]);
            }
        }
    }
    return dp[m][n];
}
```

### 4. 编辑距离
```java
public int minDistance(String word1, String word2) {
    int m = word1.length(), n = word2.length();
    int[][] dp = new int[m + 1][n + 1];
    for (int i = 0; i <= m; i++) dp[i][0] = i;
    for (int j = 0; j <= n; j++) dp[0][j] = j;

    for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {
        for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {
            if (word1.charAt(i - 1) == word2.charAt(j - 1)) {
                dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1];
            } else {
                dp[i][j] = Math.min(dp[i - 1][j - 1], 
                           Math.min(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1])) + 1;
            }
        }
    }
    return dp[m][n];
}
```

// 动态规划基础示例
import java.util.*;

public class DPBasics {

    // 1. 斐波那契数列（空间优化）
    public int fib(int n) {
        if (n <= 1) return n;
        int prev2 = 0, prev1 = 1;
        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
            int curr = prev1 + prev2;
            prev2 = prev1;
            prev1 = curr;
        }
        return prev1;
    }

    // 2. 爬楼梯
    public int climbStairs(int n) {
        if (n <= 2) return n;
        int prev2 = 1, prev1 = 2;
        for (int i = 3; i <= n; i++) {
            int curr = prev1 + prev2;
            prev2 = prev1;
            prev1 = curr;
        }
        return prev1;
    }

    // 3. 最大子数组和
    public int maxSubArray(int[] nums) {
        int maxSum = nums[0];
        int currentSum = nums[0];
        for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {
            currentSum = Math.max(nums[i], currentSum + nums[i]);
            maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, currentSum);
        }
        return maxSum;
    }

    // 4. 0-1背包问题
    public int knapsack(int[] weights, int[] values, int W) {
        int n = weights.length;
        int[] dp = new int[W + 1];
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            for (int w = W; w >= weights[i]; w--) {
                dp[w] = Math.max(dp[w], dp[w - weights[i]] + values[i]);
            }
        }
        return dp[W];
    }

    // 5. 最长递增子序列
    public int lengthOfLIS(int[] nums) {
        int[] dp = new int[nums.length];
        Arrays.fill(dp, 1);
        int maxLen = 1;
        for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {
            for (int j = 0; j < i; j++) {
                if (nums[j] < nums[i]) {
                    dp[i] = Math.max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1);
                }
            }
            maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, dp[i]);
        }
        return maxLen;
    }

    // 6. 零钱兑换
    public int coinChange(int[] coins, int amount) {
        int[] dp = new int[amount + 1];
        Arrays.fill(dp, amount + 1);
        dp[0] = 0;
        for (int i = 1; i <= amount; i++) {
            for (int coin : coins) {
                if (coin <= i) {
                    dp[i] = Math.min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1);
                }
            }
        }
        return dp[amount] > amount ? -1 : dp[amount];
    }

    // 7. 最长公共子序列
    public int longestCommonSubsequence(String text1, String text2) {
        int m = text1.length(), n = text2.length();
        int[][] dp = new int[m + 1][n + 1];
        for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {
            for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {
                if (text1.charAt(i - 1) == text2.charAt(j - 1)) {
                    dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1;
                } else {
                    dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]);
                }
            }
        }
        return dp[m][n];
    }
}
